ter's state:\n• Sober: increases the damage suffered by the target.\n• Drunk: applies the Gravity state to the target and the Brewing state to the caster.\n\nThe Brewing state prevents the spell from being used in the Drunk state.\nThe spell's range is modifiable in the Sober state, but it is halved if the caster is Drunk."},{"id":12819,"name":"Fermentation","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12360-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["200% of level to shield (1T)","200% of level to shield (1T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["220% of level to shield (1T)","220% of level to shield (1T)"]},{"grade":3,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["240% of level to shield (1T)","240% of level to shield (1T)"]}],"description":"Applies a shield on the targeted ally immediately and on the next turn."},{"id":12785,"name":"Bamboo Grove","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12387-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[]}],"description":"Summons multiple Little <color=#ebc304>{{spell,12824,1::Bamboos}}</color> in an area of effect.\n\nThe Bamboos die at the start of the caster's next turn."},{"id":12790,"name":"Eviction","element":"earth","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12361-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":2,"critChance":5,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":11,"max":13,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":14,"max":16,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":2,"critChance":5,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":13,"max":15,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":16,"max":18,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":3,"ap":2,"minRange":1,